```mdl
verdict TranscriptionService: The EDGE transcription endpoint is called directly by the transcribe handler; only response schemas are defined locally.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-video/src/operations/transcribe.ts#TranscriptionError, github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-video/src/operations/TranscriptionService.ts#TranscriptResponse]
  note: |
    No injectable service: the handler `fetch`es the pinned `https://dxos.network/transcription/video`
    URL with `url` and `lang` (default "en") and throws `TranscriptionError` on non-2xx, success=false
    or empty text. Not lazily loaded as a service, and untested.
```

